<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech CZK 1.8 mln audited 1996 net profit.</title>
<headline>Czech CZK 1.8 mln audited 1996 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Czech petrochemical concern Chemopetrol Group a.s. on Monday said it posted an audited net profit for 1996 of 1.8 million crowns, down from 894 million crowns in 1995.</p>
</text>
